ions of companies resulting in control, (ii) revaluation gains or losses accounted for following a loss of control, and (iii) changes in earn-outs subsequent to acquisitions resulting in control. Note 8.2. Other operating income and expense Other operating income (expense) in 2024 Other operating income (expense) represented a net expense of €(179) million in 2024 and consisted mainly of the following items: (in € millions) Notes Related income (expense) Impact of the sale of the EDP business in Russia 3 227 Impact of the sale of the assets related to the US premium organic dairy activities 4 41 Impact of the sale of Michel et Augustin 5.2 36 Donation to the Danone Ecosystem association (50) Impairment of intangible assets 11.3 (51) Transformation projects (a) (314) FINANCIAL STATEMENTS 4.1 Consolidated financial statements and Notes to the Consolidated financial statements (a) Mainly in Europe and North America. DANONE - UNIVERSAL REGISTRATION DOCUMENT 2024 103"
