on-recurring expense of €114 million. It mainly includes a donation to the association Danone Ecosystème, expenses in connection with transformation projects, and the disposal of EDP activities in Russia. In 2023, Danone generated a net non-recurring expense of €47 million, which consisted mainly of expenses relating to the deconsolidation of activities in Russia and to the Local First plan. DANONE - UNIVERSAL REGISTRATION DOCUMENT 2024 147"
