ss-mandated evaluation by National Academies of Sciences to improve the process of developing Dietary Guidelines for Americans. _______________________________________ (a) Subject to renewal of her term of office by the Shareholder’s Meeting of April 24, 2025. Current terms of office Danone companies ■ Director, member of the CSR Committee of DANONE SA Terms of office expired over the past five years - DANONE - UNIVERSAL REGISTRATION DOCUMENT 2024 403"
